WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.263
Part 2: building the Entra ID
target and migrating onto it.

2
00:00:04.263 --> 00:00:06.701
Module 3 is the target design.

3
00:00:06.701 --> 00:00:09.512
The chapter's premise
fits in one sentence.

4
00:00:09.512 --> 00:00:13.725
In Active Directory, where an object
sits decides what applies to it.

5
00:00:13.725 --> 00:00:17.525
In Entra ID, what an object
says about itself decides.

6
00:00:17.525 --> 00:00:22.100
So the target has to be built from
attributes, not copied from containers.

7
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:27.882
The environment throughout is a Microsoft
365 Government Community Cloud tenant,

8
00:00:27.882 --> 00:00:31.485
which uses the worldwide
Microsoft Graph endpoint,

9
00:00:31.485 --> 00:00:35.088
not the separate endpoints
that GCC High and DoD use.

10
00:00:35.088 --> 00:00:39.151
Check each feature against the
government service descriptions,

11
00:00:39.151 --> 00:00:40.990
because some reach GCC later.
